2326	2337	2368	2369	the widow	697	" You 've but a sorry lodging , Mrs. Sheppard , "
2356	2366	2368	2369	the widow	697	" It 's wretched enough , indeed , Sir , "
2371	2390	2400	2400	Wood	325	" but , poor as it is , it 's better than the cold stones and open streets . "
