84972	85113	85125	85125	Trenchard	351	" With the help of his comrade , Jack Sheppard , the young rascal made a bold push to get out of the round - house , where my janizaries had lodged him , and would have succeeded too , if , by good luck,--for the devil never deserts so useful an agent as I am , Sir Rowland,--I had n't arrived in time to prevent him . As it was , my oldest and trustiest setter , Abraham Mendez , received a blow on the head from one of the lads that will deprive me of his services for a week to come,--if , indeed it does not disable him altogether . However , if I 've lost one servant , I 've gained another , that 's one comfort . Jack Sheppard is now wholly in my hands . "
